B.FB=s(["Dopa does not operate its own synchronization service. However, Dopa is not expressly excluded from Android system backups in the current Android configuration. If Android backup is enabled, Android may include certain private app data, such as preferences and compatible files, in a backup associated with the user\u2019s Google Account and restore it to a device. The availability, protection, retention, and deletion of those backups depend on Android, the device, and the user\u2019s backup settings; Dopa does not manage them."],t.s)
