B.FZ=s(["Dopa\u2019s code does not include a developer-operated server or an app-owned analytics or synchronization system that receives the local data described in Section 3. Third-party communication is limited to Google services required for ads and Android backups that may occur according to device settings. Google processes advertising SDK information under its own terms and policies.","Dopa does not sell local protection data, PDF documents, or personal reading history. It does not share them with advertisers through its own server."],t.s)
B.G2=s(["IP address, which Google may use to estimate a general location.","Interactions with the app and ads, such as launches, taps, and ad views.","App or SDK diagnostics and performance information.","Device or account identifiers, such as Android Advertising ID or App Set ID, depending on configuration, availability, and SDK version."],t.s)
